// 🟡 gated — feature: std/cardinality.dag refinement + std/float.dag / std/integer.dag (T-3 Wave-A2) — DECISIONS.md Part 6 · SL-3229-LLVM-WIDTH.
// 🟡 gated — feature: JSON object duplicate-name rejection (I-JSON / stricter-than-RFC8259§4 profile) — DECISIONS.md Part 6 · SL-3229-T4-FORMAT-JSON-IJSON-UNIQUENESS.
